      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Streets in Wadesboro honor Revolutionary War figures such as George Washington, Nathaniel Greene, Daniel Morgan, Griffith Rutherford, Thomas Wade, William Washington, Richard Caswell, and Alexander Martin.",
